<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Milionar - Rust crate licences</title>
<style>
body { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 60em; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1em; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Rust crates in Milionar</h1>
<p>The Rust crates from crates.io that are built into the Milionar app (macOS arm64 and
Windows x64), with the licence each one is used under and its licence text. Generated
by cargo-about from Cargo.lock. The crates of this project itself are GPL-3.0-only
(see LICENSE). SDL 3 itself, built from the sdl3-src crate, and the parts it bundles:
see SDL3-zlib.txt. Other components: see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<h2>Licences</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3{{#if first_of_kind}} id="{{id}}"{{/if}}>{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
<li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
